# Animation-pack source staged for tools/unreal.cjs. NOT shipped to players —
# the game loads only the derived clips.json. Ignored BY DEFAULT so a pack can
# never be committed to main by accident: hand one over with `git add -f` on a
# side branch, which is the only route that can be undone completely. See
# import/README.md.
import/*
!import/README.md
